		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A wraith-like purple spirit that babbles to itself constantly. Souls of the desperate and insane.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 13, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 touch +2 (mind drain) and babble, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> -4, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Babble</strong>. Creatures within near that hear, CHA 12+ at start of their turn or dazed and no action.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Mind Drain</strong>. Target takes 1d4 WIS damage. On a critical hit, loses 1d4 WIS permanently. Allip regains 5 HP per WIS point inflicted. Permanently insane at 0 WIS.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
